{"meetingId": "577", "tickets": [
{"title": "Account security follow-up", "text": "Restore Evan Thimblefern's access to the client document portal by 2026-08-18 without changing his primary email address. The portal rejected his one-time code twice and locked the account, preventing him from uploading the requested transfer packet and mortgage statement screenshots.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-08-18", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "7a767e68-0323-54d8-9ff6-706018dcfde7", "subTasks": [], "evidence": "he asked for access restoration without changing his primary email address, and the agreed follow-up is to restore access by 2026-08-18"},
{"title": "Follow up on missing signature", "text": "Use this workflow when a submitted form, agreement, authorization, or disclosure is returned incomplete because one or more required signatures, initials, or dates are missing. Confirm the exact missing items, provide a clean signing path, and document completion before resubmission. The receiving custodian indicated Evan Thimblefern's rollover request from the Juniper Jellyfish Benefits 401(k) cannot move forward because the latest statement and a required signature guarantee page are missing.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2026-08-22", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "3cde169a-b7dc-591b-9e92-db5e6af5ebf7", "subTasks": [{"title": "Identify the missing signature items", "text": "Review the returned paperwork or custodian notice and list each missing signature, initial, date, or capacity designation. Note whether wet ink, electronic signature, witness, notary, or spousal consent is required. The custodian flagged the missing latest Juniper Jellyfish Benefits statement and required signature guarantee page.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Send corrected signing instructions", "text": "Prepare a concise follow-up message with the affected document name, the specific pages or fields requiring action, acceptable signing method, and how the client should return the completed item.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Verify completed packet before resubmission", "text": "After receipt, confirm all signature requirements are complete and legible, then resubmit through the appropriate channel and save confirmation in the client record.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}], "evidence": "the receiving custodian indicated that the rollover request cannot move forward because the latest Juniper Jellyfish Benefits statement and a required signature guarantee page were missing; the unresolved documentation need is dated 2026-08-22"},
{"title": "Resolve beneficiary record mismatch", "text": "Reconcile the beneficiary record for Evan Thimblefern's brokerage account at Velvet Acorn Custody, where planning notes list Lila Thimblefern as primary beneficiary while the custodian profile shows no primary beneficiary on file. Confirm and correct the designation with the custodian.", "priority": null, "dueDate": "2026-08-26", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": null, "subTasks": [], "evidence": "planning notes list Lila as primary beneficiary on Evan's brokerage account while the custodian profile screenshot shows no primary beneficiary on file; the agreed follow-up is to address the mismatch by 2026-08-26"},
{"title": "Coordinate benefits enrollment support", "text": "Use this coordination template when a client requests help reviewing employer benefits enrollment options, such as health coverage, HSA or FSA elections, disability coverage, group life insurance, retirement plan deferrals, or voluntary benefits. Keep recommendations within planning scope and document assumptions. Evan Thimblefern requested review of Clockwork Clover Systems health plan, HSA, disability coverage, group life, and 401(k) deferral choices before submitting elections.", "priority": "medium", "dueDate": "2026-08-31", "assigneeId": null, "templateId": "7509ead6-3ca2-5c84-bdb4-b75b976cb097", "subTasks": [{"title": "Gather enrollment materials from client", "text": "Ask the client for the benefits guide, plan comparison tables, premium costs, employer match details, enrollment portal screenshots if needed, and any questions they want addressed.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Prepare planning review notes", "text": "Mira Quillwhistle reviews benefit choices for cash-flow impact, retirement contribution opportunities, tax considerations, coverage gaps, and coordination with existing planning assumptions.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": "404e3513-579d-5368-b97f-3a7639c794de", "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Return decision summary to client", "text": "Provide a plain-language summary of key tradeoffs, items the client must decide directly, and questions to take to the employer benefits administrator or insurer.", "priority": "medium", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}, {"title": "Update planning records after enrollment", "text": "Once the client confirms elections, update planning inputs for premiums, retirement contributions, HSA or FSA amounts, insurance coverage, and employer match assumptions.", "priority": "low", "assigneeId": null, "dueDate": null}], "evidence": "Evan said Clockwork Clover Systems opened its annual election window and requested review of health plan, HSA, disability coverage, group life, and 401(k) deferral choices before submitting elections; the agreed review is due 2026-08-31"}
]}
